== jobs.txt:105 sync | file:docs/deploy.md | file:docs/deploy.alice.md | file:docs/deploy.bob.md
patches: 3
applied: [True, True, True]
# Deploying the billing service

1. Announce the deploy in #ops and wait 5 minutes.
2. Check that the build on main is green and that the canary passed.
3. Pull the release branch:

       git fetch origin
       git checkout release/2.5

4. Run the database migrations:

       ./manage.py migrate --plan
       ./manage.py check --deploy
       ./manage.py migrate

5. Restart the workers one at a time:

       systemctl restart billing-worker@1
       systemctl restart billing-worker@2

6. Watch the error rate on the dashboard for fifteen minutes.
7. If it goes above 2%, roll back with `./deploy.sh rollback`.
8. Post the release notes in #billing.

--- end
